Hi {Owner},

I build websites for wedding and event planners around {City}. {Business Name} plans lovely events, but there's no site that explains your service levels or lets a couple check whether you're free on their date.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: full planning, partial planning and day-of coordination explained, a budget planner, a twelve-month checklist download, a portfolio by event type and a corporate events request form, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting, new events and price changes. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth fifteen minutes on a weekday?

